isInside is operation
isInside purpose "Decide whether a jump from one label to another returns to a loop from inside it: the labels are the same, or the target is a loop the source is within"
isInside invariant none
isInside typeParameter none
isInside input source String borrowed
isInside input labels subset.Labels borrowed
isInside input from syntax.Word copied
isInside input to syntax.Word copied
isInside input region Region borrowed
isInside output Bool
isInside outputOwnedBy none
isInside raises syntax.Rejection
isInside effect none
isInside uses none
isInside memoryHeap true
isInside async false
isInside maxRecursion none
isInside label begin loopKind none
isInside label begin within none
isInside label climb note "Each pass moves to the loop around the current label; `within` never cycles (refined check, R503)"
